                                                "sense_id": "819994ab-0bf6-3ee8-b33b-e401abd44ebe",
                                                "text": "Varieties of peridotite are distinguished by their mineral composition; for example, dunite is a peridotite which is virtually all olivine, and a dense, dark green in colour."
                                            }
                                        ]
